<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Operation: Silent Night</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Christmas is coming, and the kingdom of Plumeria is preparing to welcome the princesses for a special dinner. Everything seems to be under control for a peaceful celebrationâ€¦ or at least that's what Adora tries to believe.&lt;br&gt;
With Catra pregnant, hormonal, and slightly impatient (okay, very impatient), Adora promises that this year's Christmas will be calm, peaceful, and free of confusion.&lt;br&gt;
The mission? Survive until December 25 without any crises, interdimensional drama, accidental explosions, or children setting fire to the castle curtains.&lt;br&gt;
However, when a boy disappears in the middle of a snowstorm, making the search impossible, the perfect Christmas turns into despair.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>Garlogan10</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
